# SpaceTrack AI — Environment Variables

# ── Browser-exposed (VITE_ prefix) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# NewsData.io API key — used in NewsContext (browser fetch is allowed by NewsData's CORS policy)
# Get yours free at: https://newsdata.io
VITE_NEWS_API_KEY=your_newsdata_io_key_here

# ── Server-side only (NO VITE_ prefix) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Hugging Face token — injected by the Vite proxy (dev) or Vercel serverless function (prod).
# This value is NEVER shipped in the browser bundle.
# Get yours at: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
HF_TOKEN=your_huggingface_token_here

# ── Vercel Deployment ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Add both variables in Vercel → Project Settings → Environment Variables:
#   VITE_NEWS_API_KEY  →  your NewsData.io key
#   HF_TOKEN           →  your Hugging Face token
